            "id": "PRRC_kwDOKMK0Rs8AAAABEJEwHg",
            "database_id": 4572917790,
            "body": "This refresh path is downstream of the creation-proof interceptor. When a proof-protected write first gets a 401, the retry issued from this `switchMap` bypasses the proof interceptor, so the refreshed request reaches the route without `X-Tobu-Creation`/`X-Tobu-Mutation` and receives an unhandled 428. Re-enter the full interceptor chain or coordinate refresh with proof negotiation, and add an expired-token write regression.",
            "created_at": "2026-11-14T09:59:46Z",
            "updated_at": "2026-11-14T09:59:47Z",
            "author": {
              "login": "copilot-pull-request-reviewer",
