            "id": "PRRC_kwDOKMK0Rs8AAAABEJEwPA",
            "database_id": 4572917820,
            "body": "These fallbacks introduce hard-coded `#777`/`white` colors in the new activity view, so the component can render with fixed light-theme colors instead of the PrimeNG dark/light tokens. The UI conventions require semantic theme tokens rather than hex/white fallbacks; remove the hard-coded fallbacks and use the project's semantic color classes/tokens consistently for the controls and their states.",
