          {
            "id": "PRRC_kwDOKMK0Rs8AAAABEJTKxQ",
            "database_id": 4573153989,
            "body": "With this interceptor order, the first protected write after access-token expiry can log out a valid user: refresh succeeds, but the retried request's expected 428 proof challenge reaches the authentication error handler, which clears the token and redirects to login. Put authentication before proof negotiation so the retried chain consumes the challenge, and add an expired-token write regression test covering both interceptors.",
            "created_at": "2026-11-14T10:42:41Z",
            "updated_at": "2026-11-14T10:42:41Z",
            "author": {
