            "id": "PRRC_kwDOKMK0Rs8AAAABEJTK3g",
            "database_id": 4573154014,
            "body": "This filter makes the existing “no PATCH from the dock” and “no PATCH while opening” assertions miss no-op PATCH requests. The transaction handler returns 200 before proof negotiation when the patch is unchanged, so such requests never acquire `X-Tobu-Mutation` and now disappear from `patches`. Keep recording all PATCH attempts for those negative assertions, and track proof-bearing requests separately for the later edit-count assertions.",
            "created_at": "2026-11-14T10:42:41Z",
            "updated_at": "2026-11-14T10:42:41Z",
